# Biome 1, level 18 — Twin Descents
#
# Two water routes with nothing in common: separate springs, separate hubs, and a gap of empty space
# between them that no conduit can cross. One descends straight, the other turns twice.
#
# Because both are water, every tile drawn can go to either — and a tile spent on the straight run
# is a tile the crooked one no longer has. The target of 360 against 364 needs both finished.

